{"date": "2016-01-26", "url": "https://img.owspace.com/Public/uploads/Download/2016/0126.jpg", "checked_at": "2026-11-03T02:15:00+00:00", "http_status": 200, "content_type": "image/jpeg", "image_sha256": "fe570ad16d17ba86f05c1f739558db82263fcbb54a21e7d1aca136e5dfb2be5e", "image_bytes": 85613, "last_modified": "Fri, 09 Sep 2016 16:13:15 GMT", "title": "宜痴迷", "title_kind": "宜", "source": null, "author": "弗拉基米尔·纳博科夫", "author_roles": ["作家"], "ocr_confidence_min": 0.5, "review_flags": ["source_not_detected"], "review_status": "machine_extracted_not_human_verified", "quotation_status": "not_collected", "status": "indexed", "excerpt": "她可以褪色，可以枯萎，怎样都可以，但只要我看她一眼，万般柔情便涌向心头。洛丽塔，我的生命之光。", "excerpt_ocr_confidence_min": 1}
